Package: plotly.dendro
Title: Plotly Dendrogram Visualizations for R
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R:
    person("Santiago", "Cano Muniz", , "tisalon@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Brings plotly Python dendrogram capabilities to R, enabling
    interactive hierarchical clustering visualizations using plotly. Provides
    functions to create, customize, and embed dendrograms in plotly figures,
    mirroring the feature set available in the Python plotly library.
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    plotly,
    Rcpp,
    stats
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
Suggests:
    dendextend,
    ggdendro,
    jsonlite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
